- `r_screen.py` on seeds 0 and 1: held-out pkg 0.75 vs 0.67 for r2pk (+0.08 [−0.03, +0.20]). The verdict is still "waiting" until seed 2 is in; `lo_pkg_rnd_s2` has started training on the GPU.

